{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I'm in FINAL phase. I have not been able to identify the specific match, players, referee, or frame scores. The evidence I've gathered (e1, e2) does not contain the match details, break distributions, referee's December qualification, or frame-by-frame points needed to answer. My searches were blocked as duplicates in recovery, and I have no verified candidate match.\n\nI must abstain rather than fabricate a combined points total.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"abstain\": true, \"reason\": \"I could not identify the specific snooker match described. The constraints (winner with one 50s, two 60s, two 70s, and \u003e1 100s break; loser with 3-4 fifty-plus breaks including one 50s, \u003e1 70s, one 90s; loser turned pro 2011-2016; referee became international referee in December before 2022) require locating a specific match's frame-by-frame scoreline and break data, plus referee biographical data. The only delivered evidence (e1: a pantheon list of UK referees; e2: a WST 404/Leo Scullion page fragment) contains none of the needed match details, break distributions, referee December-qualification date, or frame points. Searches in recovery were blocked as duplicates and produced no new candidate. Without a verified match and its frame scores, the combined points total cannot be determined, and I will not fabricate one.\"}","name":"finish"},"id":"call_6e2b8e8b7d294acbaa591f85","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789482719,"id":"chatcmpl-cab1aaea-3927-95d7-96e7-e2b438f6dc50","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":14393,"completion_tokens":307,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":14700,"cached_tokens":896,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":896},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}